//svelte.dev/docs/kit/routing","note":"src/routes + + 字首；用 <a>，沒有框架專用 <Link>","route":"B7-Svelte","routeLabel":"12","wiki":"references/design-wiki/前端架構名詞與取捨.md","face":"wiki"},{"id":"B7-Svelte-11","name":"load","grade":"B7","tags":["平臺","B7","B7-Svelte"],"url":"https://svelte.dev/docs/kit/load","note":"universal +page.js ≠ server +page.server.js","route":"B7-Svelte","routeLabel":"12","wiki":"references/design-wiki/前端架構名詞與取捨.md","face":"wiki"},{"id":"B7-Svelte-12","name":"+server / 內容協商","grade":"B7","tags":["平臺","B7","B7-Svelte"],"url":"https://svelte.dev/docs/kit/routing","note":"HTTP 動詞匯出；與 +page 同目錄時看 Accept","route":"B7-Svelte","routeLabel":"12","wiki":"references/design-wiki/前端架構名詞與取捨.md","face":"wiki"},{"id":"B7-USD-x01","name":"OpenUSD Home","grade":"B7","tags":["向量","B7","B7-USD"],"url":"https://openusd.org/release/index.html","note":"高效能可擴充套件平臺，協作構造動畫 3D 場景；schema 覆蓋幾何 / 著色 / 燈 / 物理；組合把資產裝成更大裝配。鏈 Get and Build、Release / Dev 源、USD WG Wiki","route":"B7-USD","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/WebXR與glTF.md","face":"motion"},{"id":"B7-USD-x02","name":"Introduction to USD","grade":"B7","tags":["向量","B7","B7-USD"],"url":"https://openusd.org/release/intro.html","note":"開源，TOST 許可。Layer + Prim / Attribute / Relationship；Composition Arcs 裝進 Stage。明確：不是繫結系統；標識用層級路徑，無 GUID","route":"B7-USD","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/WebXR與glTF.md","face":"motion"},{"id":"B7-USD-x03","name":"Terms and Concepts","grade":"B7","tags":["向量","B7","B7-USD"],"url":"https://openusd.org/release/glossary.html","note":"組合 = 按弧把多層裝成 UsdStage。強度序現行口令是 LIVERPS：Local / Inherits / VariantSets / Relocates / References / Payload / Specializes。Relocates 是層元資料裡的路徑對映，不是把源資產改名","route":"B7-USD","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/WebXR與glTF.md","face":"motion"},{"id":"B7-USD-x04","name":"USD Tutorials","grade":"B7","tags":["向量","B7","B7-USD"],"url":"https://openusd.org/release/tut_usd_tutorials.html","note":"教程在倉 extras/usd/tutorials，版本對齊 GitHub release。環境要 PYTHONPATH / PATH。Advanced Build Configuration 另頁；首頁「Get and Build」本輪未解析到穩定 URL","route":"B7-USD","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/WebXR與glTF.md","face":"motion"},{"id":"B7-USD-x05","name":"PixarAnimationStudios/OpenUSD","grade":"B7","tags":["向量","B7","B7-USD"],"url":"https://github.com/PixarAnimationStudios/OpenUSD","note":"AOUSD Core Spec 自稱 derived from 此專案，並把「OpenUSD」專指開源專案，以別於書面 USD。構建入口以倉內 build_usd.py 為準","route":"B7-USD","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/WebXR與glTF.md","face":"motion"},{"id":"B7-USD-x06","name":"Alliance for OpenUSD","grade":"B7","tags":["向量","B7","B7-USD"],"url":"https://aousd.org/","note":"JDF / Linux Foundation 下的非營利。使命：標準化、演進、開發、增長。創始：Pixar / Adobe / Apple / Autodesk / NVIDIA。Steve May 任初始主席。General Member 年費 $10,000，且須先是 LF 會員。論壇 forum.aousd.org","route":"B7-USD","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/WebXR與glTF.md","face":"motion"},{"id":"B7-USD-x07","name":"USD Core Specification","grade":"B7","tags":["向量","B7","B7-USD"],"url":"https://aousd.org/usd-core-specification/","note":"書面開放標準：語法與型別、文件資料模型、LIVERPS 組合演算法、Stage 填充與取值、USDA / USDC / USDZ 檔案格式、符合性量規。域規範（幾何 / 材質 / 物理）另開，本批不蒸","route":"B7-USD","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/WebXR與glTF.md","face":"motion"},{"id":"B7-USD-x08","name":"Core Spec 1.0 公告 + v1.0.1 正文","grade":"B7","tags":["向量","B7","B7-USD"],"url":"https://aousd.org/news/core-spec-announcement/","note":"第一份 Core Spec。主席 Steve May 寫：這是 邁向 ISO 的第一步，不是已經有 ISO 號。1.1 計劃 2026。規範倉與樣例實現分兩個 GitHub","route":"B7-USD","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/WebXR與glTF.md","face":"motion"},{"id":"B7-USD-x09","name":"MaterialX Home","grade":"B7","tags":["向量","B7","B7-USD"],"url":"https://www.materialx.org/","note":"平臺無關的看發 / 材質交換。2012 ILM，2017 開源，2021 成 ASWF 第七個託管專案。庫許可 Apache-2.0。首頁仍把現行庫寫成 v1.39.4（2025-09-15：WebGPU SL、hex-tile、NanoColor、動畫材質）","route":"B7-USD","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/WebXR與glTF.md","face":"motion"},{"id":"B7-USD-x10","name":"MaterialX Specification + 核心稿 1.39","grade":"B7","tags":["向量","B7","B7-USD"],"url":"https://www.materialx.org/Specification.html","note":"節點圖 + XML（.mtlx）。核心規格描述網路與材質；幾何指派可走 MaterialX Geometry Extensions，也可用 USD 或宿主自己的繫結。配套：Standard Nodes / PBR / NPR / GeomExts / Supplement","route":"B7-USD","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/WebXR與glTF.md","face":"motion"},{"id":"B7-USD-x11","name":"MaterialX 倉 / v1.39.5","grade":"B7","tags":["向量","B7","B7-USD"],"url":"https://github.com/AcademySoftwareFoundation/MaterialX/releases/tag/v1.39.5","note":"庫比首頁公告新一檔。加 Slang 生成、硬體 VDF、compound material。UsdPreviewSurface 定義跟到 Pixar 2.5 頁 的 opacity / opacityMode / opacityThreshold。PBR 文把 UsdPreviewSurface、Khronos glTF PBR、OpenPBR 並列成著色模型示例","route":"B7-USD","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/WebXR與glTF.md","face":"motion"},{"id":"B7-USD-x12","name":"UsdPreviewSurface","grade":"B7","tags":["向量","B7","B7-USD"],"url":"https://openusd.org/release/spec_usdpreviewsurface.html","note":"預覽互換用的最小節點組，不是完整看發。金屬 / 高光雙工作流。Storm 對四通道貼圖 + 另路 opacity 有預乘近似。目標是 2018 年起能在 DCC / 即時之間搬資產","route":"B7-USD","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/WebXR與glTF.md","face":"motion"},{"id":"B7-USD-x13","name":"UsdMtlx","grade":"B7","tags":["向量","B7","B7-USD"],"url":"https://openusd.org/release/api/usd_mtlx_page_front.html","note":"USD 的 MaterialX 檔案格式 + shader discovery 外掛。概念對映：node→UsdShadeShader，material→UsdShadeMaterial，materialassign→UsdShadeMaterialBindingAPI。不是 1:1；幾何名錶達式、light context、geominfo / visibility 等明確不支援。能讀的 .mtlx 仍可能丟掉特性","route":"B7-USD","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/WebXR與glTF.md","face":"motion"},{"id":"B7-USD-x14","name":"ISO/IEC 12113:2022 目錄","grade":"B7","tags":["向量","B7","B7-USD"],"url":"https://www.iso.org/standard/83990.html","note":"付費。題名是 Khronos glTF 2.0 執行時投遞，不是 OpenUSD。只記入口，不搬。B3-XR 已點過","route":"B7-USD","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/WebXR與glTF.md","face":"motion"},{"id":"B7-USD-x15","name":"ASWF MaterialX 專案頁","grade":"B7","tags":["向量","B7","B7-USD"],"url":"https://www.aswf.io/projects/materialx/","note":"本輪重定向到 2026-01-22 Slang 博文，不是專案卡","route":"B7-USD","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/WebXR與glTF.md","face":"motion"},{"id":"B7-USD-x16","name":"ASWF USD Working Group","grade":"B7","tags":["向量","B7","B7-USD"],"url":"https://wiki.aswf.io/display/WGUSD","note":"部署實踐與子組（含 USD MaterialX）；不是 AOUSD，也不是 Pixar 實現真身。David Morin 在 AOUSD 頁寫 ASWF WG 做 liaison","route":"B7-USD","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/WebXR與glTF.md","face":"motion"},{"id":"B7-Vue-01","name":"Vue 3 指南根","grade":"B7","tags":["平臺","B7","B7-Vue"],"url":"https://vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html","note":"「You are reading the documentation for Vue 3」；漸進式；Options / Composition 同一底層","route":"B7-Vue","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/前端架構名詞與取捨.md","face":"wiki"},{"id":"B7-Vue-02","name":"用法分層","grade":"B7","tags":["平臺","B7","B7-Vue"],"url":"https://vuejs.org/guide/extras/ways-of-using-vue.html","note":"無構建指令碼 / Web Component / SPA / SSR / SSG；petite-vue 不再維護（末版 3.2.27）","route":"B7-Vue","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/前端架構名詞與取捨.md","face":"wiki"},{"id":"B7-Vue-03","name":"響應式深度","grade":"B7","tags":["平臺","B7","B7-Vue"],"url":"https://vuejs.org/guide/extras/reactivity-in-depth.html","note":"本批樞紐。Proxy + ref getter/setter；Reactivity Transform 已棄","route":"B7-Vue","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/前端架構名詞與取捨.md","face":"wiki"},{"id":"B7-Vue-04","name":"Compiler-Informed VDOM","grade":"B7","tags":["平臺","B7","B7-Vue"],"url":"https://vuejs.org/guide/extras/rendering-mechanism.html","note":"「Vue's rendering system is based upon」VDOM；patch flags / tree flattening","route":"B7-Vue","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/前端架構名詞與取捨.md","face":"wiki"},{"id":"B7-Vue-05","name":"Vue 3.5 公告","grade":"B7","tags":["平臺","B7","B7-Vue"],"url":"https://blog.vuejs.org/posts/vue-3-5","note":"無 breaking；響應式重構；props 解構穩定預設開；lazy hydrate / useId","route":"B7-Vue","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/前端架構名詞與取捨.md","face":"wiki"},{"id":"B7-Vue-06","name":"3.5+ props 解構","grade":"B7","tags":["平臺","B7","B7-Vue"],"url":"https://vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html","note":"3.4 及以下解構是常量；3.5+ 編譯器改寫為 props.foo","route":"B7-Vue","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/前端架構名詞與取捨.md","face":"wiki"},{"id":"B7-Vue-07","name":"3.5+ useTemplateRef","grade":"B7","tags":["平臺","B7","B7-Vue"],"url":"https://vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html","note":"執行時字串 ID；v-for 裡的 ref 陣列要 3.5+","route":"B7-Vue","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/前端架構名詞與取捨.md","face":"wiki"},{"id":"B7-Vue-08","name":"現行穩定版","grade":"B7","tags":["平臺","B7","B7-Vue"],"url":"https://github.com/vuejs/core/releases/latest","note":"v3.5.41（2026-08-05）。不是 3.6","route":"B7-Vue","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/前端架構名詞與取捨.md","face":"wiki"},{"id":"B7-Vue-09","name":"Vapor 官方說明","grade":"B7","tags":["平臺","B7","B7-Vue"],"url":"https://github.com/vuejs/core/releases/tag/v3.6.0-rc.1","note":"3.6 Pre-release；「100% opt-in」；「feature-complete in Vue 3.6 RC」","route":"B7-Vue","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/前端架構名詞與取捨.md","face":"wiki"},{"id":"B7-Vue-10","name":"Pinia 產品根","grade":"B7","tags":["平臺","B7","B7-Vue"],"url":"https://pinia.vuejs.org/","note":"「The intuitive store for Vue.js」；約 1.5kb","route":"B7-Vue","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/前端架構名詞與取捨.md","face":"wiki"},{"id":"B7-Vue-11","name":"Pinia 介紹 / Vuex","grade":"B7","tags":["平臺","B7","B7-Vue"],"url":"https://pinia.vuejs.org/introduction.html","note":"官方新推薦；Vuex 5 未出、改推 Pinia；2025 起丟掉 Vue 2","route":"B7-Vue","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/前端架構名詞與取捨.md","face":"wiki"},{"id":"B7-Vue-12","name":"defineStore","grade":"B7","tags":["平臺","B7","B7-Vue"],"url":"https://pinia.vuejs.org/core-concepts/","note":"Option / Setup 兩語法；store 是 reactive 包，解構要 storeToRefs","route":"B7-Vue","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/前端架構名詞與取捨.md","face":"wiki"},{"id":"B7-Vue-13","name":"Vue 官方狀態頁","grade":"B7","tags":["平臺","B7","B7-Vue"],"url":"https://vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/state-management.html","note":"核心組維護 Pinia；Vuex maintenance mode。Nuxt 只點存在","route":"B7-Vue","routeLabel":"13","wiki":"references/design-wiki/前端架構名詞與取捨.md","face":"wiki"},{"id":"B7-WasmGC-01","name":"Core 3.0 活稿","grade":"B7","tags":["平臺","B7","B7-WasmGC"],"url":"https://webassembly.github.io/spec/core/","note":"頁首 Release 3.0 (2026-08-12)；Latest Draft 即本 URL","route":"B7-WasmGC","preview":"common/Wasm加法.html","routeLabel":"12","wiki":"references/design-wiki/WASI與元件模型.md","face":"wiki"},{"id":"B7-WasmGC-02","name":"3.0 變更史","grade":"B7","tags":["平臺","B7","B7-WasmGC"],"url":"https://webassembly.github.io/spec/core/appendix/changes.html","note":"GC 與 Exception Handling 已寫入 3.0；未見 threads / JSPI 節","route":"B7-WasmGC","preview":"common/Wasm加法.html","routeLabel":"12","wiki":"references/design-wiki/WASI與元件模型.md","face":"wiki"},{"id":"B7-WasmGC-03","name":"GC 提案倉","grade":"B7","tags":["平臺","B7","B7-WasmGC"],"url":"https://github.com/WebAssembly/gc","note":"Overview 過時；第一階段看 MVP；fork 稿仍寫 2.0+gc（2024-12-09）","route":"B7-WasmGC","preview":"common/Wasm加法.html","routeLabel":"12","wiki":"references/design-wiki/WASI與元件模型.md","face":"wiki"},{"id":"B7-WasmGC-04","name":"異常處理倉","grade":"B7","tags":["平臺","B7","B7-WasmGC"],"url":"https://github.com/WebAssembly/exception-handling","note":"throw / throw_ref / try_table / exnref；另有 Legacy EH","route":"B7-WasmGC","preview":"common/Wasm加法.html","routeLabel":"12","wiki":"references/design-wiki/WASI與元件模型.md","face":"wiki"},{"id":"B7-WasmGC-05","name":"Threads 提案","grade":"B7","tags":["平臺","B7","B7-WasmGC"],"url":"https://github.com/WebAssembly/threads","note":"本波 Active Phase 4；共享線性記憶體 + atomics","route":"B7-WasmGC","preview":"common/Wasm加法.html","routeLabel":"12","wiki":"references/design-wiki/WASI與元件模型.md","face":"wiki"},{"id":"B7-WasmGC-06","name":"JSPI","grade":"B7","tags":["平臺","B7","B7-